    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u963F\u66FC\u5FB7\u56E0\u4E3A\u8001\u961F\u957F\u7684\u4E8B\u4E00\u5B9A\u538B\u529B\u5F88\u5927\u3002\u827E\u7C73\u8389\u548C\u535A\u91D1\u68EE\u4E00\u76F4\u5728\u52AA\u529B\u5BFB\u627E\u51FA\u8DEF\uFF0C\u83B1\u6587\u7BA1\u7406\u7740\u961F\u4F0D\u7684\u540E\u5907\u3002"
    en: 'Amanda must be under a lot of pressure because of the old captain. '
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 1
    enBranch:
    - 'Emily and Bokinson have been working hard to find a way out. '
    - Levine is managing the team's reserve supplies.
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 5
    expression: 1
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u8FD8\u6709\u961F\u957F\u4F60\u2026\u2026\u5F53\u961F\u957F\u7684\u611F\u53D7\u4E00\u5B9A\u5F88\u8F9B\u82E6\u3002"
    en: And you, Captain... Being captain must feel very difficult.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 5
    expression: 3
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u6211\u4E0D\u60F3\u56E0\u4E3A\u81EA\u5DF1\u7684\u539F\u56E0\u7ED9\u5927\u5BB6\u5E26\u53BB\u56F0\u6270\u3002"
    en: I do not want to trouble everyone because of my own problems.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 0
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 5
    expression: 3
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 0
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u2026\u6BD5\u7ADF\u6BD4\u8D77\u5176\u4ED6\u4EBA\uFF0C\u6211\u8FD9\u6837\u786C\u585E\u8FDB\u6765\u7684\u961F\u5458\u5F88\u96BE\u8BA9\u4EBA\u4E00\u4E0B\u5B50\u653E\u5FC3\u3002"
    en: ...After all, compared to the others, a team member who was forced onto the
      team like me is hard to trust right away.
